# Deliberately narrow.
#
# This repository has no `* text=auto` rule and must not acquire one: ten source files are
# Windows-1252 without a BOM, and a normalisation pass would rewrite them into something Roslyn reads
# differently on Windows and on Linux.
#
# What is declared here is only the binary test fixtures, whose whole value is that their bytes are
# the bytes some earlier version wrote. Git's own binary detection would probably reach the same
# conclusion; "probably" is not good enough for a file that exists to be compared byte for byte.

*.witdb binary
*.idx   binary
